{"paper_id": "pap_kimi_k3_primary", "title": "Kimi K3: Open Frontier Intelligence (Technical Report)", "authors": ["Moonshot AI"], "year": 2026, "venue": {"name": "technical report (GitHub)", "peer_reviewed": false}, "urls": {"primary": "https://github.com/MoonshotAI/Kimi-K3/blob/main/k3_tech_report.pdf"}, "version": "", "retrieved_at": "2026-07-28", "status": "active", "tags": ["attention", "residual_stream", "moe", "kernel", "frontier_model", "primary_source"], "notes": "Primary-source read (47pp PDF, corrects/supersedes pap_kimi_k3 which was a secondary blog summary). 2.8T MoE model: Kimi Delta Attention (KDA, linear-attention delta-rule w/ channel-wise forget gate, 3:1 interleave w/ full Gated MLA), Attention Residuals (AttnRes, learned per-layer pseudo-query softmax retrieval over ALL preceding layer outputs), Stable LatentMoE (896 routed experts, 16 active, normalized+GLU+quantile-balanced), MXFP4/MXFP8 QAT post-training.", "fingerprint": "bc14cb1325d2d168"}
